    skos:prefLabel 'Hiden Analytical Inc.'@en ;
    skos:definition 'A UK and US-based company specialising in the design, development and manufacture of advanced quadrupole mass spectrometers for vacuum, gas, plasma, and surface science. Founded in 1981 in Warrington, the United Kingdom, Hiden Analytical also has regional headquarters in Livonia, Michigan, United States.'@en ;
    skos:notation 'SDN:L35::MAN0194'^^xsd:string .
